  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed roof extension, due to the excessive size and scale, and inappropriate position and design, would result in a bulky, incongruous and unsympathetic addition to the host property, which would unbalance the appearance of the pair of houses, appear out of character with the general street scene, and fail to preserve the character and appearance of the Osterley Park Conservation Area. This would be contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), CC4 (Heritage) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) and the intent of the Residential Extension Guidelines."
